-- Governed column dictionary for the store-sales demo (all layers).
-- Source of meaning, by layer:
--   gold   : docs/reference/tables/gold.*.md (authored per-column meanings).
--   silver : the same conformed gold vocabulary, by matching column name.
--   bronze : the business meaning its silver alias carries, else the column's
--            own TPC-DS name expanded (TPC-DS is the raw source standard).
-- Applied with COMMENT ON COLUMN, which survives a pipeline full refresh.
-- Re-run after a rebuild to reproduce the dictionary in Unity Catalog.

-- ===== GOLD =====
